2 CONT #	[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Innocent_IV#New_pope,_same_emperor New pope, same emperor]
2 CONT #	[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Innocent_IV#First_Council_of_Lyon First Council of Lyon]
2 CONT #	[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Innocent_IV#After_Lyon After Lyon]
2 CONT #	[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Innocent_IV#Ruler_of_princes_and_kings Ruler of princes and kings]
2 CONT #	[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Innocent_IV#Northern_Crusades Northern Crusades]
