2 CONT
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORTHERN%20ITALY%201100-1400.htm#BernaboDoriadied1325
2 CONT
2 CONT BERNABÒ Doria, son of BRANCALEONE Doria & his wife Catarina Zancha ([1254]-[Jun 1325]).  Zurita records that Jaime II King of Aragon received “Francisco y Conradino y Marcello Marques de Malaspina que...tenian estados en la isla d
2 CONC e Cerdeña y Branca de Oria y Bernabe su hijo...Genoueses” to discuss the situation in Sardinia, proposing that Bernabo should marry “la hija de Ugolino Juez de Gallura...Juana...señora de la tercera parte del reyno Calaritano”[170
2 CONC ].  Signore di Sasello e del Logoduro.  The Chronicon Astense records that "Barnaba filius Branchæ de Auria" was installed as "capitaneus" but was imprisoned by "Opicinus Spinola" in 1308 after he had attempted an alliance with th
2 CONC eir enemies the Grimaldi family[171]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ELIANA Fiesco, daughter of FEDERIGO Fiesco & his wife Teodora Spinola.  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not been identified. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernabo & his wife had three children: 
