2 CONT i)          CORRADO Spinola .  The Chronicon Astense records that "Conradum filium Oberti Spinolæ" was installed as "capitaneum…Januæ" after the death of his father[397].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ARGENTINA Fiesco, daughter of OPIZZONE Fiesco & his wife Simona ---.  The name of Corrado’s wife is not known.  
