2 CONC oan Fitz Henry was: 
2 CONT * '''Sir Robert Aguillon b abt 1225, of Addington, Surrey, and Walton, Hertfordshire, England, d 15 Feb 1285/86. He md [1] Joan de Ferrers bef Aug 1256, daughter of Sir William de Ferrers, Earl of Derby, and Sibyl Marshal. He md [
2 CONC 2] Margaret.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Robert Aguillon and Joan de Ferrers was:
2 CONT *Isabel Aguillon b abt 1258, of Addington, Surrey, England, d aft 1316. She md Sir Hugh 
2 CONT
