2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: Count of Provence and Forcalquier 4th Count Of Provence. Acceded 1209. The Last & Most Illustrious Of The Royal Provencal Counts. His Poetry Entitles Him To A Distinguished Rank Among The Troubadour Poets. Relativel
2 CONC y Impoverished; Could Provide Little Dowry For His Daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT Relationship to compiler: 22nd great grandfather
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information: Ramón married Beatrice DE SAVOIE Contessa di Savoia, daughter of Tommaso (Thomas) DE SAVOIE Count of Savoy, Aosta and Moriana and Beatrix (Marguerite) DE GENÈVE, on 5 Jun 1219 in Dez, France. (Beatrice DE SAV
2 CONC OIE Contessa di Savoia was born in 1206 in Chambèry, Savoie, France and died in Dec 1266 in Aragón, Spain .)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes:  Of, Chambery, Savoie, France
