2 CONT Marguerite of Provence (Forcalquier, Spring 1221[1] – 21 December 1295, Paris) was the eldest daughter of Ramon Berenguer IV, Count of Provence and Beatrice of Savoy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents [hide]
