2 CONC 129  ^ Costain, The Magnificent Century, pp. 129–30  ^ Costain, The Magnificent Century, p. 142  ^ Costain, The Magnificent Century, p. 167  ^ Costain, The Magnificent Century, pp.130–140  ^ Costain, The Magnificent Century, pp. 2
2 CONC 53–54  ^ Costain, The Magnificent Century, pp. 206–07  ^ Howell, Eleanor (Eleanor of Provence) (c.1223–1291), queen of England" 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bibliography  Margaret Howell, Eleanor of Provence: Queenship in Thirteenth-century England, 1997  Howell, Margaret (2004), "Eleanor (Eleanor of Provence) (c.1223–1291), queen of England", Oxford Dictionary of National Biography, 
2 CONC Oxford: Oxford University Press, http://www.oxforddnb.com/view/article/8620, retrieved 2010-12-14   FMG on Eleonore Berenger of Provence  The Peerage: Eleanor of Provence: [1]  Thomas B. Costain, The Magnificent Century, Doubleday
2 CONC  and Company, Garden City, New York, 1959 
2 CONT
