2 CONC detto Zaccaria…and…his brother Manuele" gave a receipt at Genoa to "Percivalis Spinula" dated 17 Apr 1287[470].  
2 CONT *m firstly ELIANA Grillo, daughter of ---.  1268.  
2 CONT *m secondly (1268) CLARISIA di Fieschi, daughter of TEDISIO di Fieschi di Lavagna & his wife Simona della Volta.  "Clarisia, wife of the late Manuele Zaccaria" appointed an agent for the sale of a female slave, on behalf of "her s
2 CONC ons Tedisio, Leonardo, Odoardo and Manfred" dated 9 May 1291[471].  Manuele & his second wife had nine children: 
