2 CONT 4.         JEAN de Savoie (-Ranverso).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  Guichenon states that Jean and his brother Pierre were monks at the monastery of Sant'Antonio di Ranverso in Pie
2 CONC monte where they died, but cites no source although the dated 1188 is placed in the margin[220]. 
