2 CONC se"[223].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' as his first wife, GUILLAUME de Genève, son of AMEDEE [I] Comte de Genève & his first wife Mathilde de Cuiseaux ([1131/37]-25 Jul 1196).  He succeeded his father in 1178 as Comte de Genève. 
