2 CONT    3. Robert (1269 - 1271).
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. Charles (12 March 1270 – 16 December 1325), Count of Valois.
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. Stillborn son (1271).
2 CONT
2 CONT After Isabella's death, he married on 21 August 1274, Maria of Brabant, daughter of Henry III of Brabant and Adelaide of Burgundy. Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Louis (May 1276 – 19 May 1319), Count of Évreux.
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Blanche (1278 – 19 March 1305, Vienna), married Rudolf III of Austria on 25 May 1300.
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Margaret (1282 – 14 February 1317), married Edward I of England
2 CONT
