2 CONT
2 CONT MARRIAGE: 15 children of King Edward & his wife Eleanor De Castile. The children were born in the following order: 
2 CONT 1. Eleanor b. June 17, 1264 d. Oct. 12, 1297 
2 CONT 2. Joan b. & d. 1265 
2 CONT 3. John b. June or July 10, 1266 d. Aug.1 or 3, 1271 
2 CONT 4. Henry b. July, 1267 d. Oct. 14, 1274 
2 CONT 5. Julian (alias Katherine) b. & d. 1271 
2 CONT 6. Joan of Acre b. 1272 d. April 23, 1307 
2 CONT 7. Alfonso b. Nov. 24, 1273 d. Aug. 19, 1284 
2 CONT 8. Margaret b. Sept. 11, 1275 d. 1318 
2 CONT 9. Berengaria b. 1276 d. 1279 
2 CONT 10. Mary b. March, 1278 d. July 8 1332 
2 CONT 11. Alice b. March 12, 1279 d. 1291 
2 CONT 12. Elizabeth b. August, 1282 d. May 5, 1316
2 CONT 13. Edward (later King Edward II) b. 1284 d. 1327
2 CONT 14. Beatrice b. 1286, & died young
2 CONT 15. Blanche b. & d. 1290
1 NOTE He ruled from 1272 to 1307.
