1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Beatrice of England (25 June 1242[1] – 24 March 1275), also known as Beatrice de Dreux, was a Princess of England as the daughter of King Henry III of England and Eleanor of Provence. Her siblings were Edward I of England, Margar
2 CONC et, Queen of Scotland, Edmund Crouchback, 1st Earl of Lancaster, Richard of England, John of England, Katherine of England, William of England, and Henry of England. She and her family were members of the Royal house of Plantagene
2 CONC t, which first ruled in the 12th century and was founded by Henry II of England."
2 CONT
2 CONT =================================================================================
