1 NOTE  Edmund was known as "Edmund Crouchback", Earl of Lancaster, Earl of Leicester, High Steward of England starting 26 October 1265. He was also Titular King of Sicily . He married Aveline about 1264. She died before 1274 and then he
2 CONC  married Blanche.
