4 CONC ber 1233–6 October 1234), Henry (2 November 1235-13 March 1271), & Nicholas ((b. & d. 17 January 1240); 2dly 23 November 1243 at Westminster Abbey of Sanchia (English called Cynthia) dau. of Beatrice of Savoy & Raymond Berenger IV
4 CONC , parents of unnamed son (July 1246-15 August 1246), & Edmund (m. Margaret de Clare); 3dly 16 June 1269 at Kaiserslautern of Beatrice of Falkenburg dau. of Dietrich I, Count of Falkenburg, parents of no issue; by mistress Joan (wi
4 CONC d. of Sir Ralph de Valletort) dau. of Sir Walter de Bath, parents of Philip (a priest), Sir Richard (m. Joan _), Sir Walter, Isabel, & Joan (m. Richard de Champernoun & Sir Peter de Fissacre) of Cornwall
