1 OCCU Count of Nevers 1273-1322 and Count of Flanders 1305-1322
1 NOTE {geni:about_me}   sources: 
2 CONT *http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00013788&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_III,_Count_of_Flanders Wikipedia]
