2 CONT For other persons named Margaret Plantagenet, see Margaret Plantagenet (disambiguation).
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of England (15 March 1275 – after 1333) was the tenth child and seventh daughter of King Edward I of England and Eleanor of Castile.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents [hide]
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 Marriage 
2 CONT
