2 CONT Margaret Plantagenet (15 March 1275 – after 1333) was the tenth child and seventh daughter of King Edward I of England and Eleanor of Castile.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 8 July 1290 she married John II, Duke of Brabant in Westminster Abbey, London. Their only child was John III, Duke of Brabant.
