2 CONT At his marriage he received from his father in law, the glory of Ligny. In 1263 he sold Names to his son-in-law Gwijde. He also accompanied the French king Louis IX during his crusade in 1270. After his death, Hendrik V was succee
2 CONC ded by his son Hendrik VI.
