2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT The first Lord of Monaco, a pirate named Lanfranco Grimaldi, was Italian and a member of a family who invaded the area in 1297, following an economic dispute with a rival clan. All Monegasque rulers have descended directly from La
2 CONC nfranco Grimaldi.
