2 CONT (a)       GIORGINO (-17 Nov 1428).  A charter dated 20 Mar 1385 records a dispute between the commune of Genoa and “dominos Lazarinum et Karolum marchiones de Carreto natos quondam domini Georgiii...et vice Georgini nepotis ipsoru
2 CONC m nati quondam domini Enriceti...” concerning their fiefs, and a settlement agreed “...cum filiis et heredibus quondam Enriceti marchionis de Carreto fratris ipsorum dominorum Lazarini et Carolli...” by charter dated 13 Jan 1385[1
2 CONC 253].  “Domini Georgini filii quondam domini Enriceti marchionis de Carreto de Finario” swore allegiance to Charles VI King of France by charter dated 27 Jan 1402[1254].  Signor di Calizzano, Santa Giulia e Sassello.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ISABELLA, daughter of [--- Conte Valperga di Caluso].  Giorgino & his wife had five children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT * (1)       BATTISTINO (-young after 1428). 
2 CONT
2 CONT * (2)       COSIMO (-young after 1428). 
2 CONT
2 CONT * (3)       GIOVANNI (-young after 1428). 
2 CONT
2 CONT * (4)       ENRICHETTO (-young after 1428). 
2 CONT
2 CONT * (5)       DEIFEBO (-young after 1428). 
