2 CONC  in Quellen und Forschungen aus dem Gebiete der Geschichte , Prag 1930, II, pp. 11, 26, 248; F. Amadei, Universal Chronicle of the City of Mantua , edited by G. Amadei - E. Mariani - G. Praticò, I, Mantua 1954, pp. 529, 561, 565; 
