2 CONT [Died] between 24 and 26.4.1338 in Sion. Son of Pierre IV and Guyonne de Rossillon. Cleric (1306), parish priest of Loèche (from 1317), student of civil law (1319), canon of the cathedral chapter of Sion and administrator of the a
2 CONC bbey of Disentis (1323), priest and pontifical chaplain (1323). Bishop of Sion (1323-1338). 
2 CONT
