2 CONT ii)         STEPHANIE (-after 1197).  The Lignages d'Outremer record that the second daughter of "Henri le Bufle" & his wife was wife firstly "dou seignor dou Boutron", who died without heirs, and secondly of "le seignor de Gibele
2 CONC t, Hue qui clocheit", and state in a later passage that she inherited "Mergelcolon et Gedin et les autres casaus que thomassin de Cesaire tient ores" on the death of her father and gave these properties to her daughter Pavie[673].
2 CONC   William of Tyre names "Guillaume Dorel Sire de Botron le quel avoit eu a espose Stephanie…fille de Henri le Bufle que Hue de Gybelet esposa puis la mort de Guillaume Dorel"[674].  The Lignages d'Outremer confirm her parentage wh
2 CONC en they name "Plaissence…fille de Hue de Gibelet et de Estefenie segonde fille de Henri de Bufle" as the wife of "le prince Borgne"[675].  1179.  The Chronicle of Ernoul records "une…dame avoist esté de Gibelet" at Tripoli and tha
2 CONC t her town was returned to her after the death of Saladin [in 1197][676].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly GUILLAUME Dorel Lord of Boutron, son of ---.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly (before 1179) HUGUES [III] Embriaco Lord of Jebail, son of HUGUES [II] Embriaco Lord of Jebail & his wife --- (-1186 or after). 
