2 CONT *3.      '''   BERTA di Clavesana''' (-after 1224).  Her parentage and marriage are confirmed by the charter dated 9 Aug 1202 which records that Bonifazio Marchese di Monferrato promised "Guilelmo filio suo" to ratify the peace ag
2 CONC reement with Alexandria and Asti and with "socero suo domino Bonefacio de Cravexana…"[1039].  Heiress of Mambarasco e Cortemiglia.   <br> '''m''' (before 9 Aug 1202) as his second wife, GUGLIELMO di Monferrato, son of BONIFAZIO Ma
2 CONC rchese di Monferrato & his first wife Elena di Busca ([1180]-17 Sep 1225).  He succeeded his father in 1207 as GUGLIELMO VI Marchese di Monferrato. 
