2 CONT i)          '''FRANCESCO d'Este''' (Ferrara Jun 1323 or 1325-Este 13 Dec 1384).  The Chronicon Estense records the birth in Jun 1323 in Ferrara of "dominus Franciscus filius domini Bertoldi"[202].  He opposed the succession of his
2 CONC  cousin Aldobrandino [III] as Signore di Ferrara in 1352, and sought support from the Visconti, Malatesta, Gonzaga and Carrara families, but renounced his claim in 1354[203].  Governor of Parma 1344.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' TADDEA di Barbiano, daughter of GIOVANNI Conte di Barbiano & his wife ---.  1393.
2 CONT
