2 CONC tament of [https://www.geni.com/people/Guillaume-II-comte-de-Gen%C3%A8ve/6000000000437339826 Guillaume] [II] Comte de Genève, dated 9 Nov 1252, names her son [https://www.geni.com/people/Aymon-de-Grandson-%C3%A8v%C3%AAque-de-Gen%C
2 CONC 3%A8ve/6000000112925434910 Aymon Bishop of Geneva] as "consanguineus", but this reference is not in the text of the version of this document which has been consulted[101].  From a chronological point of view, the suggestion seems 
