2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Pagano della Torre''' was born in 1175. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-124125281 Iacopo della Torre] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-111343436 Berta Visconti]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pagano married [https://www.geni.com/profile-124122193 Agathe de Genève]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-111343318 Ermanno della Torre]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34628693756 Napoleone della Torre]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34628693760 Francesco della Torre]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-346286
2 CONC 93767 Carnevorio della Torre]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34664602719 Salvino della Torre]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34631520220 Avone, Podesta di Pistoia della Torre]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34631520225 Martino del
2 CONC la Torre]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34631520230 Filippo della Torre]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34631520235 Paganino della Torre]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725440586 Ada Blancha della Torro]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on January 6, 1241 in Italy. 
