2 CONT 14.       JUAN de Aragón .  Bofarull names “una Señora llamada doña María” as mother of the king’s illegitimate children “D. Jaime Perez, D. Juan y Da Beatriz que casó con D. Ramon de Cardona” (no sources cited)[602].  The primary
2 CONC  source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  
