1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 7.             MECHTILD von Braunschweig ([1276]-[26 Apr/31 Aug] 1318, bur Glogau).  The Chronica Principum Brunsvicensium names (in order) "Henricum, Albertum, Wilhelmum, Conradum, Othonem, Luderum et Mechtildem" 
2 CONC as children of "Albertus" & his second wife[126].  The Chronica Principum Brunsvicensium names "duci Glogovie" as husband of "Mechtildis [filia Alberti]" and their marriage "1291 mense Maio"[127].  The Epytaphia ducum Slezie name 
2 CONC "Mechtildam, filiam ducis de Brunzwik" as wife of "Heynricus dux Glogowie", specifying that she was buried in Lüben[128].  m (May 1291) HEINRICH I Duke of Glogau, son of KONRAD I Duke of Glogau [Piast] & his first wife Salomea of 
2 CONC Poland [Piast] ([1251/60]-[7/9] Dec 1309, bur Kloster Leubus).  
