2 CONT 2.             MARGUERITE de France (-1294).  Betrothed (Nov 1294) to Infante don FERNANDO de Castilla, son of don SANCHO IV "el Bravo" King of Castile and León & his wife doña María Alfonso de Molina “la Grande” (Seville 6 Dec 12
2 CONC 85-Jaen 7 Sep 1312).  He succeeded in 1295 as FERNANDO IV "el Ajurno" King of Castile and León. 
