2 CONT
2 CONT d)             BLANCHE de France (1311 or 1312-Longchamps 26 Apr 1358, bur Longchamps).  The necrology of Longchamp provides on 2 Jan for a mass for "Phelippe roy de France et de Navarre et la reyne Jehanne de Bourgoingne pere et 
