4 CONC 7 (1882–5) · J. C. Parsons, ed., The court and household of Eleanor of Castile in 1290, Pontifical Institute of Mediaeval Studies: Texts and Studies, 37 (1977) · Thomae Walsingham, quondam monachi S. Albani, historia Anglicana, ed
