1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====Medlands (27 Feb 2024): [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLAND,%20Kings%201066-1603.htm#Margaretdied1318Or1333 England, Kings 1066-1603]
2 CONT * 12. '''MARY''' (Windsor Castle 12 Mar or 22 Apr 1279-Amesbury Abbey before 8 Jul 1332, bur Amesbury Abbey).  The Continuator of Florence of Worcester records the birth "''vigilie S Gregorii apud Windleshores''" 11 Mar [1279] of 
2 CONC "''filiam…Mariam" to "Alienora regina Anglie''"[821].  The ''Chronicle of John de Oxenedes'' records that “''Alianora regina Angliæ''” gave birth “v''igilia sancti Gregorii apud Windleshorem''” 1279 to “''filiam...Mariam''”[822]. 
2 CONC  The ''Annals of Worcester'' record the birth “''IV Id Mar''” of “''regina Angliæ…filiam apud Woodstock…vocata est'' ---”[823].  She became a nun at Amesbury Abbey, Wiltshire 15 Aug 1285.  The Continuator of Florence of Worcester 
2 CONC records that "''Maria filia regis Angliæ''" became a nun at Amesbury "''die Nativitatis beatæ Mariæ''" 8 Sep[824].  A charter dated 2 Jan 1292 records that “''rex...filiæ nostræ Mariæ''” became a nun “''apud Ambresburiam''”[825]. 
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT MARY "PRINCESS OF ENGLAND" ~
2 CONT She never married.
