2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         RICHARD [II] de la Chambre (-[9 Sep 1324/1325]).  Vicomte de Maurienne.  Foras says that Richard [II] was “sous la curatelle de Béatrix sa mère“ 16 Sep 1294[1035].  His testament is dated 9 Sep 1324, Foras saying that h
2 CONC e died “vers 1325“[1036].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' MARIE de Lineriis [Liveriis], daughter of --- (-after 1326).  Foras records her marriage and family origin (no sources cited) and says that “elle vivait encore en 1326“[1037].  Richard [II] & his wife had one child (the pr
2 CONC imary sources which confirm the existence of other children named in secondary sources have not been identified): 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a)         JEAN [II] de la Chambre (-[6 Nov 1371/1372]).  Vicomte de Maurienne.  Foras records that Jean was “sous la tutelle de Marie de Lineriis sa mère“ in 1326 and “sous la curatelle de Boniface de Cuyne chev. et de Guigue de
2 CONC  Pont damoiseau” in 1333[1038].  -        see below. 
