1 OCCU Sieur de Jarnac, de Château-Larcher, de Brulain, de Châteauneuf, de Saint-Hermi, Seigneur de Jarnac
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Geoffroi de Lusignan, Seigneur de Jarnac was born on 1228 in Lusignan, Vienne, Poitou-Chantres, France to Hugh X de Lusignan, Count de la March and Isabella D'Angouleme.  Geoffroi married (1.) Jeanne de Chatellerau
2 CONC lt and had a child:  Eustachie de Lusignan.  Geoffroi married (2.) Unknown MNU BEFORE 1259.
2 CONT
2 CONT Geoffroi de Lusignan, Seigneur de Jarnac is my 26th great uncle.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Geoffroi de Lusignan (d. 1274), seigneur of Jarnac, married in 1259 Jeanne de Châtellerault, Vicomtess of Châtellerault (d. 16 May 1315) and had issue: Eustachie de Lusignan (d. Carthage, Tunisia, 1270), married 1257 Dreux I
2 CONC II de Mello (d. 1310)
2 CONT
