1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jeanne de Chatellerault, Vicountess of Chatellerault was born on 1235 in France to Aimery de Chatellerault, Vicomte de Chatellerault and Agathe de Dammartin de Chatellerault.  Jeanne married (1.) Geoffroi de Lusign
2 CONC an, Seigneur de Jarnac.  Jeanne married (2.) Jean II de Harcourt, Marechal de France AFTER 1274.
2 CONT
