2 CONT ==Amadeus VIII (Pope Felix V), Duke of Savoy1
2 CONT Last Edited	29 Sep 2009
2 CONT '''M, #19235, b. 4 September 1383, d. 7 January 1451'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Amadeus VII 'the Red', Duke of Savoy b. 24 Feb 1360, d. 1 Nov 1391
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Bonna du Berry b. 1366, d. 30 Dec 1435
2 CONT Charts	14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland (#1)
