2 CONT 14 Generation Pedigree of Friedrich Wilhelm III, King of Prussia
2 CONT '''Amadeus VIII (Pope Felix V), Duke of Savoy was born on 4 September 1383 at Chambery, Savoy. He married Mary of Burgundy''', daughter of Philip II 'the Bold', Duke of Burgundy and Marguerite de Dampierre, '''in May 1401. Amadeus
2 CONC  VIII (Pope Felix V), Duke of Savoy died on 7 January 1451 at Geneva, Switzerland, at age 67.'''
2 CONT '''Family	Mary of Burgundy''' b. Aug 1380, d. 2 Oct 1422
2 CONT '''Children'''	
2 CONT *Margareta of Savoy2 b. 13 May 1405, d. 1418
2 CONT *Anton of Savoy2 b. 1407, d. b 12 Dec 1407
2 CONT *Anton of Savoy2 b. 1408, d. a 10 Oct 1408
2 CONT *Maria of Savoy b. c 31 Jan 1411, d. Dec 1469
2 CONT *Amadeus of Savoy, Prince of Piedmont2 b. 26 Mar 1412, d. 17 Aug 1431
