2 CONT
2 CONT elgian Duke of Brabant. He was the 3rd Duke of Brabant in Holy Roman Empire (reigned 1235 to 1248). He was also know as "le Magnanime", "the Courageous", and "the Magnanimous." He was married twice and had at least four children.
