2 CONT
2 CONT ^ The Nature of the Early Ottoman State, Heath W. Lowry, 2003 SUNY Press, p.153
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ History of the Ottoman Empire and Modern Turkey, Stanford Jay Shaw, Cambridge University Press, p.24
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Helmolt, Ferdinand. The World's History, p.293. W. Heinemann, 1907.
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Fine, John. The Late Medieval Balkans, p.410. University of Michigan Press, 1994. ISBN 0472082604.
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Cantemir, Dimitrie, History of the Growth and Decay of the Ottoman Empire, London 1734.
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Gibbon, Edward, Decline and Fall of the Roman Empire, Modern Library, v. iii, p. 651
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Finkel, C., Osman's Dream: The History of the Ottoman Empire, 2005, pp.19, Basic Books
