2 CONT     Cawley, Charles, Medieval Lands Project on Waleran IV, Duke of Limburg, Foundation for Medieval Genealogy, retrieved August 2012
2 CONT     Cawley, Charles, Medieval Lands Project on Dukes/Counts of Limburg, Foundation for Medieval Genealogy, retrieved August 2012
