1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *[http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thierry_le_Diable '''Thierry de Lorraine dit le Diable ou d'Enfer'''] (Tirriz li anfer) († av. 1244), fut seigneur d'Autigny. Il est le fils de Ferry Ier , seigneur de Bitche, duc de 
2 CONC Lorraine, comte d'Alsace et comte de Metz, mort le 7 avril 1206 (selon le nécrologe de Sainte-Marie-aux-Bois) et de Ludomille de Pologne (1148-1223). À la mort de son père, il obtient la seigneurie d'Autigny et son château en héri
2 CONC tage.
2 CONT
2 CONT *[https://books.google.fr/books?id=rcNcAAAAcAAJ&dq=guillaume%20du%20chasteler&hl=fr&pg=PA4#v=onepage&q=mortagne&f=false Genealogie de la maison du Chasteler, avec les preuves] par Francois-Gabriel-Joseph Marquis Du-Chasteler (1777
2 CONC )
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/LORRAINE.htm#FerryIdied1206B
2 CONT
2 CONT FERRY de Lorraine, son of MATHIEU I Duke of Lorraine & his wife Berta [Judith] von Staufen (before 1155-7 Apr 1206, bur Stürzelbronn Abbey[93]).  ... He succeeded his brother in 1206 as FERRY I Duke of Lorraine, ... m ([1167]) WIE
2 CONC RCHOSŁAWA LUDMILLA of Poland, daughter of MIESZKO III "Stary/the Old" Prince of Greater Poland & his first wife Erszebet of Hungary (before 1153-in Poland before 1211). ... Ferry & his wife had eleven children:  
2 CONT
2 CONT *1.         FERRY de Lorraine (-[8/9] Oct 1213, bur Stürzelbronn Abbey).  ... He succeeded his father in 1206 as FERRY II Duke of Lorraine.  -        see below.  
2 CONT *2.         MATHIEU de Lorraine (-murdered near Nompatelize 16 May 1217). ... Mistress (1): ---, nun at the abbey of Epinal. ... Mathieu had one illegitimate child by Mistress (1):  
2 CONT **a)         ALEIDIS (-Cronberg Castle after 1217).  ... m ---.  The name of Aleidis´s husband is not known. 
2 CONT *3.         PHILIPPE de Lorraine (-before Nov 1240).  ... m AGNES, daughter of ---. ... Philippe & his wife had one child:  
2 CONT **a)         JOATHE [Judith] de Lorraine . ... m as his second wife, HUGO [II] von Bliescastel Comte de Lunéville [Graf von Lützelstein], son of HUGO [I] von Bliescastel & his wife Kunigund von Kyrburg (-after 4 Aug 1246).  ...
2 CONT *4.         MATHIEU de Lorraine (-killed Apr 1217).  
2 CONT *5.         HENRI de Lorraine "Lombarta/le Lombard" (-22 Jan before 1261).  ...  Seigneur de Bayon 1250.  m firstly (after 1230) as her second husband, DAMETE de Pesmes, widow of HENRI Seigneur de Fouvent, daughter of ---, sister 
2 CONC of JACQUES de la Résie (-before 1256, bur Senones).  ... m secondly (before 23 Apr 1256) as her second husband, SOPHIE, widow of KONRAD von Riste, daughter of --- (-24 Sep before 1285, bur Abbaye de Beaupré).  ... children of firs
2 CONC t marriage: -        SEIGNEURS de BAYON[115].  
2 CONT *6.         '''THIERRY de Lorraine "d'Enfer/du Diable" (-[Joinville] before Jun 1244). ''' The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  Seigneur d'Autigny, under the division of territories agreed 
2 CONC on the death of his father[116].  Mistress (1): ALIX de Nogent, daughter of ANDRE Seigneur de Nogent-en-Bassigny & his wife --- (-before 1256).  She married (before 1234) Simon [III] de Parroye (-before 1254).  Thierry had one pos
2 CONC sible illegitimate son by Mistress (1):  
2 CONT **a)         [FERRY (-before 1296).  There is no proof that Ferry was the son of Thierry Seigneur d'Autigny.  However, his supposed father's seigneurie was in his possession in 1244 and his arms were similar to those of the Dukes 
2 CONC of Lorraine[117].  Sire du Châtelet.  Seigneur d'Autigny Jun 1244.]  
2 CONT *7.         JUTTA [Judith] de Lorraine ([1171]-19 Mar after 1245, bur Senones Abbey).  ... m (before 1189) HEINRICH [III] von Salm, son of HEINRICH [II] Graf von Salm & his wife Joathe --- (-Jan 1246, bur Senones Abbey). ...
2 CONT *8.         CUNEGONDE de Lorraine (-before 1213).  ... m as his first wife, WALERAN de Limbourg Seigneur de Montjoie, son of HENDRIK III Duke of Limburg & his wife Sophie [von Saarbrücken] (-Cremona 2 Jul 1226, bur Rode Abbey).  H
2 CONC e succeeded his father in 1221 as WALERAN III Duke of Limburg.  
2 CONT *9.         HADWIGE de Lorraine (-after 1228).  ... m HEINRICH [I] Graf von Zweibrücken, son of SIMON [I] Graf von Saarbrücken & his wife Mechtild --- (-1228).  
2 CONT *10.      daughter (-20 Mar [before 1231]).  ...
2 CONT *11.      AGATHE de Lorraine (-12 Jul 1242).  ... Abbess of Bouxières before 1236.  
2 CONT *12.      --- de Lorraine (-after 1198). ... She was elected Abbess of Etanche before 1198[125].  
2 CONT
