2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Theobald I was married three times; to Ermesinde (Isabella) of Bar-sur-Seine, Adelheid von Loos (Looz) & Ermesinde (Ermesinda) de Namur and was succeeded as count by his eldest son Henry II, by his first marriage. His eldest daugh
2 CONC ter Agnes, by his second marriage, married Frederick II, Duke of Lorraine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Frederick II, Duke of Lorraine
