1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_of_Courtenay '''Robert of Courtenay (1201-1228) - '''] Wikipedia - English
2 CONT * [http://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_van_Courtenay '''Robert van Courtenay (1201-1228) - '''] Wikipedia - Netherlands
