2 CONT 2.     '''    AMEDEE''' (-14 or 16 Feb 1247).  "Amedeus dominus de Iaiz" confirmed previous donations to the Chartreuse d'Oujon, with the consent of "filiis meis Stephano et Amedeo", by charter dated 17/18 Dec 1210[424].  Seigneur
2 CONC  de Gex.  "Amedeus dominus de Jayz" granted concessions on payment of taxes to the priory of Satigny by charter dated 1233[425].  "Amedeus dominus de Jayz" certified a renunciation of rights by "D. Memerius miles de Versenai", by 
2 CONC charter dated 1234[426].  "Amedeus D. de Jaiz" swore homage to "Petro de Sabaudia filio Thome quondam comitis Sabaudie" [in his capacity as Seigneur de Faucigny], save for his fidelity to "comitis Gebennensis", by charter dated 12
2 CONC  Jun 1234[427].  "Amedeus dominus de Gex" granted compensation to the bishopric of Geneva for the wrongs which he had committed, with the consent of "Dne Beatricis uxoris sue", by charter dated 30 Jul 1236[428].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (contract 4 Jun 1227) BEATRIX de Bâgé, daughter of ULRIC [V] Seigneur de Bâgé & his second wife Alexandrine de Vienne [Bourgogne-Comté] (-after 23 Nov 1251).  The marriage contract of "Amedeus dominus de Gez" and "Beatrice
2 CONC m filiam domini de Baugiaco" is dated 4 Jun 1227 and names "Rainoldo de Baugiaco fratri meo"[429].  "Amedeus dominus de Gex" granted compensation to the bishopric of Geneva for the wrongs which he had committed, with the consent o
2 CONC f "Dne Beatricis uxoris sue", by charter dated 30 Jul 1236[430].  "Leoneta filia et heres…Amedei quondam domini de Jaiz" promised not to marry without the consent of "D. Petro de Sabaudia", with the consent of "D. Willelmi comitis
2 CONC  Vyenensis tutoris mei", by charter dated 23 Nov 1251, witnessed by "…G. domini de Baugis et domine B matris mee"[431]. 
