2 CONT >>Ludwig was the son of Eberhard III, Graf von Landau, and his second wife Guta von Gundelfingen. Ludwig went to Italy to become a condottiere, and became leader of the 'Grand Company' of condottieri in Italy. He married Isotta Vi
2 CONC sconti, an illegitimate daughter of Barnabó Visconti, lord of Milan, Bergamo, Cremona, Lodi and Bologna, and a mistress Beltameda Cassa. They had two sons, Eberhard and Konrad, who would both have progeny. Ludwig died on 30 Septem
2 CONC ber 1398.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isotta (d. 1388), married in 1378 to Count Lutz von Landau, condottiero under the name of Lucio Land (d. 1398).
