2 CONT Various sources imply that a relationship existed between Graf Eberhard IV der Junger and Agnes, the daughter of the Stuttgart mayor, Werner von Dagersheim, who lived at his court at the time. Sources suggest he fathered two child
2 CONC ren by her, both of whom took their mother's name of "Von Dagersheim". Her daughter Elisabeth aka Antonia married Graf Ullrich's chancellor Konrad LYHER.
