1 NOTE Duke Leopold IV of Hapsburg, son of Leopold III, was heir to the Empire of Austria when his father died in 1386.  Leopold was co-ruler with his brother, William.  When William died in 1406, leaving Leopold IV to rule alone until 1
2 CONC 411.  His successor was his brother, Ernest.
