2 CONT as for  2022 note of https://www.geni.com/people/Anselmo-I-del-Vasto-1-marchese-di-Ceva/6000000001355763205 :
2 CONT {please don't abuse the copy / paste of whole pages of generic text, maybe even duplicated in automatic translation .. it's free but annoying and very very noob. }
