2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret FitzAlan is the daughter of Sir Richard Fitzalan, 8th Earl of Arundel and Alasia di Saluzzo.1 She married William le Botiler, son of William le Botiler, 1st Lord le Botiller and Beatrice (?).1
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became le Botiler.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Margaret FitzAlan and William le Botiler
2 CONT
2 CONT William le Botiler, 3rd Lord le Botiller+ b. c 1331, d. 14 Aug 13691
2 CONT
