1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ENGLISH%20NOBILITY%20MEDIEVAL1.htm#RichardFitzAlandied1302B
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         JOHN de Arundel (-after 5 Dec 1375).  The will of "Richard Earl of Arundel and Surrey", dated 5 Dec 1375, bequeathed property to “Richard my son...my son Thomas Bishop of Ely...John my son...Joane my daughter [...Counte
2 CONC ss of Hereford]...Alice my daughter...the eldest daughter of my said son John...Henry and Edward the younger sons of my said son John...William another son of my said son John...my nephews and nieces sons and daughters of Roger le
2 CONC  Strange and to my sister Dame Alaine le Strange wife to the said Roger...my...uncle John Arundell”[110]. 
