2 CONT
2 CONT "Daughter of Richard FitzAlan de Arundel and Alice Alasia de Saluzzo. Grand daughter of 
2 CONT John FityzAlan and Isabel de Mortimer, Tommaso I, Marchese de Saluzzo and Alusia de Ceva. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Sir Stephen Segrave, 3rd Lord Segrave, son of Sir John and Christine de Pelssy,Constable of the Tower of London. They had three sons; Edmund, Sir John and Stephen, 3th Lord Segrave." 
2 CONT
