2 CONT * 2.         PIETRO (-[21 Dec 1099/1121]).  ...
2 CONT * 3.         MANFREDO (-[4 Jun 1175/Mar 1176], bur Staffarda).  ... ... -        MARCHESI di SALUZZO. 
2 CONT * 4.         UGO (-after 18 Aug 1162). ... ... ...  ... 
2 CONT * 5.         GUGLIELMO (-after 1160). ... ...  -        MARCHESI di BUSCA e LANCIA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT   Marchese Bonifazio & his [first/second] wife had two children: 
2 CONT * 6.         ANSELMO (-after 1140). ... ... -        MARCHESI di CEVA e CLAVESANA. 
2 CONT * 7.         BONIFAZIO (-after 22 Dec 1142). ... ... 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT   Marchese Bonifazio & his [second] wife had six children: 
2 CONT * 8.         daughter (before [1108/15]-). ...
2 CONT * 9.         ENRICO [I] "il Guercio" (Clavesana [1115]-Finale 1184). ... ... -        MARCHESI di SAVONA e CARETTO. 
2 CONT * 10.      BONIFAZIO "minor" (-[1188/26 May 1190]). ... ... ...
2 CONT * 11.      OTTONE "Boerio" (-before 1188).  ... ... ...
2 CONT * 12.      SIBILLA (-before 11 Dec 1146). ... ... .... ... ...
