1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/MONFERRATO,%20SALUZZO,%20SAVONA.htm#BonifazioVastodied11251135 FMG (19 Mar 2022) "Monferrato, Saluzzo"]==
