1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Agnes of Babenberg (1111 – January 25, 1157) was the daughter of Leopold III, Margrave of Austria from 1095 to 1136, and his wife, Agnes of Germany, daughter of Henry IV, Holy Roman Emperor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes of Babenberg married, in 1125, Ladislaus the Exile of Poland (Vladislaus II, the Exile) (1105 - 1159), High-Duke of Poland (1138 - 1146). Their daughter, Richilde of Poland, married Alfonso VII, King of Castile and Leon, amo
2 CONC ngst others.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/L1DL-9GM
2 CONT --------------------
