2 CONC n of a monastery by charter dated 2 Apr 1220 "domini Guidonis de Plozasco", by charter dated 14 May 1219[530].  "Domina Agnete filia condam domini Mainfredi marchionis de Saluciis" bought property for Rifreddo monastery by charter
2 CONC s dated 7 Dec 1222, 22 Feb 1223, 31 Mar 1223 (twice)[531].  m as his second wife, COMITA Judge of Torres, son of --- (-1218). 
