2 CONT *'''Marguerite III d'Avesnes, Comtesse de Hainaut et Gravin van Holland en Zeeland1
2 CONT *'''F, #1991, b. 1311, d. circa 1356
2 CONT *Last Edited=27 Oct 2013
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.47%
2 CONT *'''     Marguerite III d'Avesnes, Comtesse de Hainaut et Gravin van Holland en Zeeland was born in 1311. She was the daughter''' of Guillaume V (III) d'Avesnes, Comte de Hainaut et Graaf van Holland en Zeeland and Jeanne de Valoi
2 CONC s.1 '''She married Ludwig IV von Bayern, Holy Roman Emperor''', son of Ludwig II Herzog von Oberbayern and Mathilde von Habsburg, '''on 25 February 1324 at Cologne, Germany.2 She died circa 1356.
2 CONT *'''     She succeeded to the title of Gravin van Holland en Zeeland in 1345.1 She succeeded to the title of Comtesse de Hainaut in 1345.1 She abdicated as Countess of Holland in 1354.1
2 CONT *'''Children of Marguerite III d'Avesnes, Comtesse de Hainaut et Gravin van Holland en Zeeland and Ludwig IV von Bayern, Holy Roman Emperor
2 CONT **Wilhelm III Herzog von Bayern-Straubing Comte de Hainaut et Graaf van Holland en Zeeland1 b. 12 May 1330, d. 15 Apr 1389
