1 CONT Ramon Berenguer IV, Count of Provence (or Raymond) (1195 - 19 August1245), Count of Provence and Forcalquier, was the son of Alfonso I,Count of Provence and Gersenda II of Sabran. Raymond married (5 June1219) Beatrice of Savoy (d.
1 CONC  1266), daughter of Margaret of Geneva andThomas I of Savoy. Raymond and Beatrice of Savoy had four beautifuldaughters, who all married kings.
1 CONT
1 CONT Marguerite of Provence, wife of Louis IX of France
1 CONT Eleanor of Provence , wife of Henry III of England
1 CONT Sanchia of Provence, wife of Richard, Earl of Cornwall
1 CONT Beatrice of Provence, wife of Charles I of Sicily
