0 @N6000000003300512843@ NOTE After Edmund married Blanche of Artois, he adopted her symbol the Provin s rose (named after a town in Champagne), which she herself had adopted f rom her first husband, Henry of Champagne. Thus, the origin of the Lancas trian red
1 CONC  rose was thoroughly French.
1 CONT
1 CONT Edmund never ruled in Sicily, despite having been nominated as king by Po pe Innocent IV.
1 CONT
1 CONT "Died of disappointment" after failing to capture Bordeaux.
1 CONT
1 CONT Earl of Leicester (1265 cr - 1st)
1 CONT Earl of Lancaster (1267 cr - 1st)
1 CONT Count of Aumale (1269 m)
