1 CONT as the real King of Sicily was still living and the Earldom of Chester was
1 CONT transfered to his elder brother Edward. He soon obtained, however, both
1 CONT possessions and dignities, for upon the forfeiture of Simon de Montfort by the
1 CONT King of the Earldom of Leicester and also the honour of the Stewardship of
1 CONT England and the lands of Nicolas de Segrave. CP,vol.VII,pp.378-387,pp.547.
