0 @N6000000002187755803@ NOTE Charles I of Sicily
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
1 CONT French Monarchy-
1 CONT Capetian Dynasty
1 CONT (direct Capetians branch)  
1 CONT
1 CONT Hugh Capet 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Robert II 
