1 CONT    Philip I 
1 CONT    Hugh, Count of Vermandois 
1 CONT Philip I 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Louis VI 
1 CONT Louis VI 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Louis VII 
1 CONT    Robert I of Dreux 
1 CONT Louis VII 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Mary, Countess of Champagne 
1 CONT    Alix 
1 CONT    Marguerite 
1 CONT    Alys, Countess of the Vexin 
1 CONT    Philip II 
1 CONT    Agnes of France 
1 CONT Philip II
1 CONT (Philip Augustus) 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Louis VIII 
1 CONT Louis VIII 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Louis IX 
1 CONT    Robert I, Count of Artois 
1 CONT    Alphonse, Count of Poitou and Toulouse 
1 CONT    Isabel of France 
1 CONT    Charles I of Anjou and Sicily 
1 CONT Louis IX 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Phillip III 
1 CONT    Robert, Count of Clermont 
1 CONT    Agnes of France 
1 CONT Philip III 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Philip IV 
1 CONT    Charles III, Count of Valois 
1 CONT    Louis d'Evreux 
1 CONT    Margaret of France 
1 CONT Philip IV 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT    Louis X 
1 CONT    Philip V 
1 CONT    Isabella of France 
1 CONT    Charles IV 
