0 @N6000000002322286994@ NOTE She was a beautiful and cultivated woman, and, with her arrival at court,
1 CONT intrigue began to flourish. In 1276, her stepson, Louis, died, and the shock
1 CONT of the event was compounded by persistent rumors of poisoning and
