1 CONT king 1212-1250, and Holy Roman Emperor 1220-1250. A Hohenstaufen, he pursued
1 CONT his dynasty's imperial policies against the papacy & the Italian city states;
1 CONT and he also joined in the Sixth Crusade (1228-1229), conquering several
1 CONT areas of the Holy Land and crowing himself king of Jerusaleem, reigning
