1 CONT Children
1 CONT 1.	 HENRY III OF ENGLAND b: 1 OCT 1207 in Winchester, Hampshire, England
1 CONT 2.	 RICHARD OF CORNWALL b: 5 JAN 1208/09 in Winchester Castle, Hampshire, England
1 CONT 3.	 Joan of England b: 22 JUL 1210 in Gloucester, England
