0 @N6000000002187582961@ NOTE Beatrix of Bourbon
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Beatrice of Burgundy (1257 – October 1, 1310) was Lady of Bourbon and, through her mother, heiress of all Bourbon estates. She was the daughter of John of Burgundy (son of Hugh IV, Duke of Burgundy) and Agnes of Dampierre. In 1272
1 CONC  Beatrice married Robert, Count of Clermont and their eldest son Louis I, le Boiteux became the first Duke of Bourbon.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] See also
1 CONT Dukes of Bourbon family tree 
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT Agnes Dame de Bourbon Succeeded by
1 CONT Robert 
