0 @N6000000005076727958@ NOTE Yolande de Bourgogne was the daughter of Eudes de Bourgogne, Comte de Nevers and Mathilda de Bourbon.1,2 She married, firstly, Jean Tristan de France, Comte de Valois, son of Louis IX, Roi de France and Marguerite de Provence, in 
