1 CONT
1 CONT ii)          FREDERIC [Ulrich] (-before 6 Feb 1319).
1 CONT
1 CONT iii)        MATHILDE (-before 6 Feb 1319).
1 CONT
1 CONT b)           AGNES (-before 1249).  m (1243) as his first wife, GUILLAUME de Vienne, son of GUILLAUME [IV] Comte de Mâcon et de Vienne [Bourgogne-Comté] & his second wife Scholastique de Champagne (-1255).
1 CONT
1 CONT children of second marriage:
1 CONT
1 CONT c)            THIEBAUT (-Basel [4 Dec 1310/7 Feb 1311]).  He succeeded his father in 1275 as THIEBAUT Comte de Ferrette.
1 CONT
1 CONT -     see below.
1 CONT
1 CONT d)           LOUIS (-before 1281).  Seigneur de Florimont.  m GERTRUD von Rappoltstein, daughter of ULRICH II Herr von Rappoltstein (-1281 or after).
1 CONT
1 CONT i)             ULRIC (-Rhine 21 Dec 1281).  Seigneur de Florimont.  He drowned in the River Rhine[161].
1 CONT
1 CONT e)           ADELAIDE (-before 1314).  Frau von Balm 1310.  m ULRICH I von Regensberg (-before 28 Jul 1281).
1 CONT
1 CONT f)             STEPHANIE (-23 Sep 1276, bur Colmar Unterlinden).  The Annales Basilienses record the death "Non Kal Oct 1276…in castro Plixiberg" of "advocatissa Alsatiæ, filia comitis Phiretarum…uxor Conradi Wernheri" and her bur
1 CONC ial "in cymiterio Sancti Ioannis-sub-thilia in Columbaria"[162].  m KONRAD WERNER III von Hattstatt (-[1324], bur Colmar Unterlinden).
1 CONT
