1 CONT Louis I Duke of Bourbon
1 CONT Count of Clermont-en-Beauvaisis
1 CONT 1342–1356 Succeeded by
1 CONT Louis II 
1 CONT Count of La Marche
1 CONT 1342–1356 Succeeded by
1 CONT James I 
