1 CONT Seigneur de Montmorency
1 CONT Died 1304
1 CONT Married before 1273
1 CONT Marie de Dreux, daughter of Robert IV de Dreux, Comte de
1 CONT Dreux et de Braine and Beatrix de Montfort, Comtesse de
1 CONT Montfort-L'Amaury
1 CONT Died 9 March 1276
1 CONT Buried Priory Haute-Bruyere
1 CONT Children, Generation XVI-830
0 @N6000000005076732729@ NOTE Alice de Montfort was born circa 1297.1 She was the daughter of Arthur II de Montfort, Duc de Bretagne and Yolande de Dreux.1 She married Bouchard VI de Vendôme, Comte de Vendôme circa 1320. She died in 1377.1
1 CONT      Alice de Montfort was also known as Alix le Dreux.
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 201. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family.
