0 @N6000000005076728862@ NOTE Agnes de Bourgogne was born in 1270.1 She was the daughter of Hugues IV de Bourgogne, Duc de Bourgogne.1 She married, firstly, Rudolf I von Habsburg, Roman King, son of Albrecht IV Graf von Habsburg and Heilwig Gräfin von Kyburg, 
1 CONC in 1284.1 She married, secondly, Peter of Chambly after 1291.1 She died in 1323.1
1 CONT      Agnes de Bourgogne was also known as Isabelle de Bourgogne.
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown and Company, 1999), table 77. Hereinafter cited as Lines of Succession.
