0 @N6000000002322312751@ NOTE Apparently, this first wife had bore daughters, but she and any daughters
1 CONT remain unnamed to this date, with no history yet discovered. Louis possessed
1 CONT courage and tenacity without being rigid. He won men over by a jovial and
1 CONT chivalrous demeanor, and his suppleness, coupled with diplomatic skill,
1 CONT charmed them even as a certain mercurial quality made him appear
1 CONT unfathomable. He was a political man, whose guiding principle remained the
1 CONT honor imperii, whose fate came up against talented and powerful adversaries.
