0 @N6000000002176649254@ NOTE He is usually not reckoned among the German kings, having been elected as
1 CONT German king of the Romans, as his deposition as German king was not
1 CONT considered necessary. Besides, his own father outlived him by 8 years. He had
1 CONT been taken prisoner after a vain attack on Worms. Imprisoned in Germany for
1 CONT awhile, he was moved to San Felice in Apulia and afterwards to a prison at
1 CONT Martirano in Calabria, where he died, probably at his own hands.
